# AI Customer Support Automation

An end-to-end n8n workflow that validates, classifies, and drafts replies to Petalnex client support tickets — with a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) knowledge base, dual-layer security screening, and a human-in-the-loop review gate for anything sensitive.

Built as a capstone project for the **Petalnex AI Automation Internship**.

